### Create a parcel
POST http://localhost:8080/api/parcels
Content-Type: application/json

{"lotNo": "LOT-1024", "district": "District A", "areaSqm": 1250.5, "tenure": "FREEHOLD"}

### Submit an application (use the parcel id returned above)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{"parcelId": 1, "type": "TRANSFER", "applicantName": "Siti Aminah", "feeAmount": 150.00}

### Move it through the workflow (use the application id returned above)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1/transitions
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "UNDER_REVIEW", "remarks": "documents received"}

### List applications under review
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications?status=UNDER_REVIEW&page=0&size=20

### Counts per status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/summary
